WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 44= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:42.310 --> 01:42.840
Keep looking.

8
01:43.040 --> 01:43.840
Check over there.

9
01:44.590 --> 01:45.400
Nothing here.

10
01:45.400 --> 01:46.950
I'm just an innocent passerby.

11
01:47.280 --> 01:49.200
We're the victims whose lives are at stake.

12
01:50.408 --> 01:51.920
Those bandits kill without hesitation.

13
01:52.230 --> 01:53.680
We won't put your life at risk.

14
01:54.184 --> 01:55.070
We'll part ways here.

15
01:55.080 --> 01:56.488
May our paths never cross again.

16
01:57.150 --> 01:57.590
Young Lady,

17
01:58.000 --> 01:59.280
you can't outrun those bandits.

18
01:59.680 --> 02:00.680
If you trust me,

19
02:02.870 --> 02:04.560
there's a little-known path here.

20
02:05.120 --> 02:06.680
You should hide behind the reeds.

21
02:07.048 --> 02:08.310
I'll draw the bandits away.

22
02:08.720 --> 02:09.780
- Nothing. - Nothing here.

23
02:09.780 --> 02:10.700
Nothing here.

24
02:14.960 --> 02:15.630
I trust you.

25
02:16.824 --> 02:18.430
His dagger was made by the government.

26
02:18.632 --> 02:19.150
Let's go.

27
02:19.150 --> 02:19.870
Over there.

28
02:30.750 --> 02:31.470
Help!

29
02:31.560 --> 02:32.240
Murder!

30
02:32.240 --> 02:32.710
Shut up!

31
02:32.710 --> 02:33.910
Help! Murder!

32
02:39.360 --> 02:40.960
Sir, don't be alarmed.

33
02:41.280 --> 02:42.710
We're merchants from southern Fujian.

34
02:43.280 --> 02:44.750
They're guards we hired.

35
02:44.960 --> 02:46.280
They only look intimidating.

36
02:46.470 --> 02:48.080
My brother and I came to Jinling

37
02:48.168 --> 02:49.208
but didn't make any money.

38
02:49.210 --> 02:51.240
To save on expenses, we're spending the night here.

39
02:51.512 --> 02:52.800
But the cook traveling with us

40
02:52.800 --> 02:54.240
stole our money and ran away.

41
02:54.840 --> 02:55.470
Sir,

42
02:55.840 --> 02:57.190
did you happen to see two women?

43
02:59.360 --> 03:00.630
I've read so much

44
03:00.664 --> 03:02.216
that my eyesight has grown poor.

45
03:03.590 --> 03:04.960
I did see someone just now

46
03:05.430 --> 03:06.630
heading that way,

47
03:07.192 --> 03:08.910
but I couldn't make out their appearance

48
03:09.000 --> 03:10.664
or tell whether it was a man or a woman.

49
03:13.030 --> 03:14.150
Thank you, sir.

50
03:19.320 --> 03:20.400
There's no need to rush.

51
03:20.560 --> 03:22.504
My cousin is the magistrate of Shangyuan County.

52
03:22.800 --> 03:23.590
My cousin and I

53
03:23.800 --> 03:24.710
arranged to meet today

54
03:24.710 --> 03:25.910
at Bali Pavilion nearby.

55
03:26.008 --> 03:27.390
That fire was quite bright just now.

56
03:27.400 --> 03:28.460
My cousin must have seen it.

57
03:28.470 --> 03:30.870
He'll surely bring the constables with him to meet me.

58
03:31.128 --> 03:31.800
When he arrives,

59
03:31.880 --> 03:33.330
he'll certainly be able to help you

60
03:33.496 --> 03:35.520
bring those two female thieves to justice.

61
03:42.870 --> 03:44.280
Every word I've said is true.

62
03:44.910 --> 03:45.910
I haven't lied to you.

63
03:48.150 --> 03:49.280
If you two don't believe me,

64
03:51.360 --> 03:52.280
why not sit down

65
03:52.800 --> 03:53.800
and wait here for a while?

66
03:55.520 --> 03:57.630
Money is only a worldly possession.

67
03:57.840 --> 03:58.800
It comes and goes.

68
03:58.952 --> 04:00.360
There's no need to dwell on it.

69
04:01.960 --> 04:03.880
The moon is especially beautiful tonight.

70
04:04.536 --> 04:06.080
It shines upon past and present alike.

71
04:08.240 --> 04:08.750
Gentlemen,

72
04:09.432 --> 04:11.208
we shouldn't let such a night go to waste.

73
04:18.600 --> 04:20.040
We still need to pack our belongings

74
04:20.040 --> 04:21.496
and hurry back to southern Fujian,

75
04:21.560 --> 04:23.430
so we won't disturb your enjoyment, sir.

76
04:44.120 --> 04:44.720
Second Chief,

77
04:45.120 --> 04:47.120
why aren't we going after those two weavers?

78
04:48.510 --> 04:49.630
No, Second Young Master.

79
04:51.992 --> 04:54.300
Young Master said the weavers are as insignificant as ants.

80
04:54.310 --> 04:55.430
They don't matter.

81
04:55.920 --> 04:58.600
But that pedantic scholar is from the Xie family of Jinling.

82
04:58.888 --> 05:01.390
If we kill him now, we'll draw the attention of the authorities

83
05:01.560 --> 05:03.120
and Jinling's prominent families.

84
05:03.256 --> 05:04.712
That would put us at a disadvantage.

85
05:06.408 --> 05:08.696
Leave no loose ends. Get out of here as soon as possible.

86
05:08.750 --> 05:09.750
Leave no trace.

87
05:10.270 --> 05:11.030
- Yes. - Yes.

88
05:11.310 --> 05:11.720
Hurry.

89
05:15.416 --> 05:16.970
The ones in the back, move it. Keep up.

90
05:17.630 --> 05:18.160
Move out.

91
05:28.830 --> 05:29.800
Clean and precise.

92
05:30.600 --> 05:31.830
Killed with a single strike.

93
05:32.920 --> 05:34.600
The killer was highly experienced,

94
05:34.632 --> 05:36.248
and someone accustomed to killing.

95
05:43.352 --> 05:44.680
Why would someone so experienced

96
05:44.680 --> 05:46.120
kill a coachman

97
05:47.310 --> 05:48.190
just

98
05:49.000 --> 05:50.390
to abduct two weavers?

99
05:51.112 --> 05:52.648
An enemy of yours, Your Lordship?

100
05:55.680 --> 05:57.310
If this were an enemy of Jinqi's,

101
05:57.800 --> 05:58.950
why go out of their way

102
05:58.950 --> 05:59.950
to abduct Xiuwan?

103
06:00.216 --> 06:01.600
They should have gone after Lanxiang

104
06:01.600 --> 06:02.870
or Zhangcheng instead.

105
06:10.120 --> 06:10.800
The kidnappers

106
06:11.310 --> 06:12.950
don't know Xiuwan's true identity.

107
06:13.480 --> 06:14.310
If they did,

108
06:14.648 --> 06:16.560
they would never have left the coachman's body

109
06:16.800 --> 06:18.310
lying carelessly in the woods.

110
06:18.568 --> 06:21.256
The kidnappers must have assumed they were two ordinary weavers.

111
06:21.560 --> 06:22.680
Even if they went missing,

112
06:22.744 --> 06:24.472
the authorities wouldn't take it seriously.

113
06:24.824 --> 06:27.048
They would only send ordinary constables to investigate.

114
06:28.630 --> 06:30.360
The wound on his neck alone

115
06:31.560 --> 06:33.000
doesn't reveal much either.

116
06:37.560 --> 06:39.960
You already know who the kidnappers are, Your Lordship.

117
06:40.920 --> 06:42.070
More than half a month ago,

118
06:42.248 --> 06:44.830
the Longjiang Garrison was escorting tribute goods to the capital

119
06:44.920 --> 06:47.544
when they encountered river bandits on a tributary of the canal.

120
06:47.920 --> 06:48.630
Everyone

121
06:49.750 --> 06:51.040
aboard was killed.

122
06:51.368 --> 06:52.630
Their wounds were similar?

123
06:57.608 --> 06:59.870
I heard those river bandits were exceptionally brutal.

124
07:00.750 --> 07:01.560
Xiuwan...

125
07:02.750 --> 07:03.560
Xiuwan...

126
07:12.580 --> 07:15.740
(Zezhi Workshop)

127
07:26.240 --> 07:27.560
We're finally back safe and sound.

128
07:28.216 --> 07:29.070
Second Young Lady.

129
07:29.630 --> 07:30.160
Come here.

130
07:32.600 --> 07:33.430
Second Young Lady,

131
07:33.736 --> 07:34.680
we mustn't tell anyone

132
07:34.680 --> 07:36.000
about what happened to us.

133
07:36.070 --> 07:38.808
Why? I was thinking we could go report it to the authorities later

134
07:38.824 --> 07:40.230
and have the kidnappers arrested.

135
07:40.240 --> 07:42.590
No, we can't. My husband and mother-in-law already disapprove

136
07:42.600 --> 07:43.810
of me working outside the home.

137
07:43.820 --> 07:44.750
They say I'm never home.

138
07:44.840 --> 07:46.510
If they find out I was abducted by bandits

139
07:46.510 --> 07:48.580
and didn't come home all night, they'll surely think

140
07:49.720 --> 07:50.830
I've been dishonored.

141
07:52.560 --> 07:54.430
Then the neighbors will gossip

142
07:55.120 --> 07:56.600
and call me an indecent woman.

143
07:57.992 --> 07:59.864
I can put up with what they say about me.

144
08:00.360 --> 08:02.630
After all, I've spent my whole life being looked down on.

145
08:07.560 --> 08:09.680
But my daughter will soon be discussing marriage.

146
08:10.510 --> 08:12.040
I can't let this ruin her reputation.

147
08:14.240 --> 08:15.830
Please take my advice, all right?

148
08:16.720 --> 08:19.070
I'm sure your mother would rather suffer herself

149
08:20.070 --> 08:21.750
than let you become the subject of gossip

150
08:21.750 --> 08:23.096
and have your reputation ruined.

151
08:26.360 --> 08:28.480
Those kidnappers were clearly the ones who did wrong.

152
08:28.936 --> 08:31.070
Why should we be the ones ashamed to face others?

153
08:34.360 --> 08:35.840
Because we're women.

154
08:37.790 --> 08:39.360
We were born to suffer.

155
08:50.136 --> 08:52.680
No wonder Gantang always says it's hard to recruit workers.

156
08:53.910 --> 08:55.080
I never understood

157
08:55.870 --> 08:57.150
why those women

158
08:58.200 --> 09:00.600
would rather humble themselves and ask men for money

159
09:01.200 --> 09:02.840
than go out and earn their own living.

160
09:04.120 --> 09:06.080
I thought they simply lacked ambition.

161
09:07.864 --> 09:09.496
It turns out it's simply because...

162
09:13.000 --> 09:14.200
we're women.

163
09:25.510 --> 09:26.320
Xiuwan.

164
09:27.720 --> 09:28.510
Madam.

165
09:31.020 --> 09:31.940
Lanxiang.

166
09:39.384 --> 09:40.240
It's all right now.

167
09:49.176 --> 09:51.360
Go back to work at Zezhi Workshop without worry.

168
09:51.670 --> 09:53.270
I already told Gantang yesterday

169
09:53.670 --> 09:55.840
to keep this quiet and carry on as usual.

170
09:56.840 --> 09:58.480
If anyone asks about last night,

171
09:58.600 --> 09:59.440
just say

172
09:59.960 --> 10:01.720
Madam wanted to inspect the new loom,

173
10:01.910 --> 10:04.600
so the Second Young Lady took you straight to the Lin Residence.

174
10:04.790 --> 10:06.790
You accidentally missed the curfew,

175
10:07.240 --> 10:08.320
so you and Shopkeeper Zhou

176
10:08.550 --> 10:10.200
spent the night at the residence.

177
10:10.984 --> 10:12.320
You're so compassionate, Madam.

178
10:12.750 --> 10:13.550
Thank you very much.

179
10:13.992 --> 10:15.910
I went to the residence to report back yesterday

180
10:16.030 --> 10:17.670
and missed the curfew,

181
10:17.720 --> 10:18.840
so I stayed there overnight.

182
10:19.320 --> 10:20.390
You were with me.

183
10:37.480 --> 10:39.440
Are you still thinking about what Lady Peng said?

184
10:41.320 --> 10:43.240
If a man encounters criminals

185
10:43.352 --> 10:44.870
and manages to escape with his life,

186
10:45.480 --> 10:47.510
everyone would be happy for him.

187
10:49.030 --> 10:50.120
But for women,

188
10:53.848 --> 10:56.240
it's as if we're the ones who've done something wrong,

189
10:56.630 --> 10:58.150
terrified that anyone might find out.

190
11:00.080 --> 11:01.630
When a man brings money home,

191
11:02.120 --> 11:04.840
everyone praises him as a good husband and father.

192
11:05.960 --> 11:08.240
When a woman works hard and brings money home,

193
11:08.790 --> 11:10.320
not only does no one praise her,

194
11:10.390 --> 11:12.000
but people also gossip about her.

195
11:13.960 --> 11:15.390
What infuriates me most is

196
11:15.750 --> 11:17.750
that it's bad enough for men to think that way,

197
11:18.360 --> 11:20.270
but even women themselves believe it,

198
11:21.016 --> 11:22.750
thinking that showing themselves in public

199
11:22.910 --> 11:24.150
and working to earn money

200
11:25.080 --> 11:26.320
makes them inferior.

201
11:33.120 --> 11:35.990
If a gentleman wishes to enlighten the people and improve their customs,

202
11:36.000 --> 11:37.440
he must begin with education.

203
11:38.870 --> 11:40.630
Women aren't ignorant or foolish.

204
11:42.150 --> 11:43.750
No one has simply ever told them

205
11:44.630 --> 11:45.840
that going out to earn money

206
11:46.270 --> 11:47.840
and supporting themselves

207
11:48.720 --> 11:50.240
is nothing to be ashamed of.

208
11:57.080 --> 11:58.200
That makes sense.

209
11:59.600 --> 12:00.720
Jade left uncarved

210
12:01.320 --> 12:02.600
cannot become a useful vessel.

211
12:03.720 --> 12:04.840
A person without learning

212
12:05.510 --> 12:06.440
cannot know the way.

213
12:09.910 --> 12:11.440
But that's simply the world we live in.

214
12:17.080 --> 12:18.270
Lanxiang, you want to become

215
12:18.790 --> 12:20.550
a teacher who enlightens women?

216
12:22.790 --> 12:23.840
It's not just me.

217
12:24.720 --> 12:25.630
There's also you.

218
12:26.200 --> 12:27.000
Me?

219
12:28.750 --> 12:30.390
You defied what others might think

220
12:30.440 --> 12:31.840
and went to work at Zezhi Workshop,

221
12:32.630 --> 12:34.000
earning your own living.

222
12:34.200 --> 12:37.550
That's teaching by example.

223
12:40.080 --> 12:41.270
Gantang even said

224
12:41.480 --> 12:43.000
that since you joined Zezhi Workshop,

225
12:43.270 --> 12:44.510
the women there

226
12:44.720 --> 12:46.870
have been laughing and talking more than ever.

227
12:48.030 --> 12:48.840
I...

228
12:49.000 --> 12:50.440
I just talk a lot,

229
12:50.750 --> 12:52.440
and I haven't had much schooling.

230
12:52.630 --> 12:54.870
How could I ever teach others the way?

231
12:58.960 --> 13:00.030
The scriptures say,

232
13:00.750 --> 13:03.000
"From one lamp, many lamps are lit,

233
13:04.120 --> 13:05.840
until ten thousand lamps shine bright."

234
13:07.160 --> 13:08.390
From one lamp,

235
13:09.120 --> 13:10.480
many lamps are lit,

236
13:12.000 --> 13:14.000
until ten thousand lamps shine bright.

237
13:16.270 --> 13:17.784
The light of a single lamp is faint

238
13:18.200 --> 13:20.200
and can illuminate only a small space.

239
13:21.200 --> 13:22.630
But if I light one lamp,

240
13:23.440 --> 13:24.720
and you light another,

241
13:25.360 --> 13:28.150
and Yuchan, Gantang, Baogai, Xiaolian,

242
13:28.480 --> 13:30.360
Furong, Ji'er, and the others

243
13:30.360 --> 13:31.440
each light one, too,

244
13:33.000 --> 13:34.510
then even the faint glow of fireflies,

245
13:35.120 --> 13:36.360
when gathered together,

246
13:37.150 --> 13:39.030
can illuminate an entire street

247
13:40.000 --> 13:41.870
and show women traveling through the dark

248
13:42.720 --> 13:44.000
the way forward.

249
13:44.000 --> 13:48.940
♪Deep within the lights lies a truth that came too late♪

250
13:48.960 --> 13:50.480
And there's Mister Shen Rugu.

251
13:51.030 --> 13:52.510
Though he isn't a woman,

252
13:52.720 --> 13:54.120
he helped light the way for us too,

253
13:54.510 --> 13:56.000
and his lamp shines especially bright.

254
13:56.200 --> 13:57.750
It was after seeing a play he wrote

255
13:57.832 --> 13:59.992
that I resolved to leave the confines of my home.

256
14:09.270 --> 14:10.840
I'm hungry.

257
14:13.550 --> 14:14.840
We'll eat when we get home.

258
14:20.670 --> 14:21.720
His Lordship is back.

259
14:24.960 --> 14:25.790
Where's Xiuwan?

260
14:27.670 --> 14:30.120
Aunt Lingxiao took her away in tears, of course.

261
14:47.790 --> 14:49.240
Old Coachman Yue was killed.

262
14:51.256 --> 14:52.840
I've already instructed Head Butler Yang

263
14:52.968 --> 14:54.840
to make proper arrangements for his family.

264
14:59.832 --> 15:01.600
You must catch the killer, Your Lordship.

265
15:02.550 --> 15:03.360
By the way,

266
15:04.328 --> 15:06.080
this is a clue about the kidnappers left

267
15:06.210 --> 15:07.768
by the righteous man who saved Xiuwan.

268
15:10.790 --> 15:12.870
What's his name? Where does he live?

269
15:13.272 --> 15:15.140
I'll visit him tomorrow to thank him in person.

270
15:15.200 --> 15:16.240
Xiuwan said

271
15:16.370 --> 15:18.720
he left after escorting them to the city gate.

272
15:19.592 --> 15:21.150
She didn't understand why at the time,

273
15:21.450 --> 15:22.840
but only realized afterward

274
15:23.320 --> 15:26.270
that he must have guessed they wouldn't report it to the authorities,

275
15:26.360 --> 15:27.840
so he left this letter.

276
15:28.216 --> 15:30.408
He said it contained portraits of the kidnappers.

277
15:30.600 --> 15:33.120
They could be handed over to the authorities or burned.

278
15:36.616 --> 15:38.870
There are plenty of people in this world who blindly follow convention

279
15:38.870 --> 15:40.320
and seek fame under false pretenses.

280
15:41.510 --> 15:42.630
I never expected this man

281
15:43.016 --> 15:44.440
to be not only noble in character,

282
15:44.968 --> 15:46.510
but also open-minded and adaptable.

283
15:47.240 --> 15:48.240
He truly is remarkable.

284
16:02.960 --> 16:04.080
His brushwork is masterful,

285
16:04.472 --> 16:06.136
and his skill at drawing is exceptional.

286
16:08.440 --> 16:09.440
I'll give the order now

287
16:09.500 --> 16:11.256
to post notices for the criminals' arrest.

288
16:13.576 --> 16:15.336
If you let word of Xiuwan's ordeal get out,

289
16:15.368 --> 16:17.390
Aunt Lingxiao will surely go to the family shrine,

290
16:17.390 --> 16:19.990
bring out the instruments of family punishment, and come after you.

291
16:21.000 --> 16:22.670
I should have explained it clearly to you.

292
16:23.720 --> 16:26.240
It's them. They robbed the tribute goods bound for the capital

293
16:26.360 --> 16:27.600
and killed Commander Ding

294
16:27.670 --> 16:29.030
and every soldier aboard.

295
16:34.150 --> 16:36.910
No wonder they abducted the weavers and stole the loom.

296
16:37.336 --> 16:39.256
They must be colluding with an overseas kingdom

297
16:39.304 --> 16:41.150
that covets our realm's weaving techniques.

298
16:42.200 --> 16:43.120
You guessed right.

299
16:43.448 --> 16:44.648
They're not river bandits.

300
16:44.910 --> 16:46.080
They're pirates from the sea.

301
16:46.480 --> 16:48.030
They usually hide out at sea.

302
16:49.030 --> 16:50.480
No wonder Jiugao and Nanke

303
16:50.550 --> 16:53.496
have been investigating for over ten days without finding a single clue.

304
16:55.120 --> 16:56.870
Why would pirates come to Jinling?

305
16:57.840 --> 16:59.320
Even if they wanted to abduct weavers,

306
16:59.600 --> 17:02.120
Songjiang Prefecture is closer to the coast than Jinling.

307
17:04.550 --> 17:05.680
Bring them back.

308
17:05.912 --> 17:07.416
Once we interrogate them, we'll know.

309
17:18.860 --> 17:20.580
(Wanted)

310
17:20.590 --> 17:21.400
Come take a look!

311
17:21.590 --> 17:22.000
Look.

312
17:22.000 --> 17:23.470
Anyone who reports their whereabouts

313
17:23.528 --> 17:25.060
will be rewarded twenty taels of silver.

314
17:25.070 --> 17:26.070
Twenty taels?

315
17:26.720 --> 17:27.270
That's a lot.

316
17:28.550 --> 17:29.270
Twenty taels!

317
17:29.480 --> 17:30.070
Let's go.

318
17:30.070 --> 17:31.640
The authorities have already posted notices at the city gate,

319
17:31.720 --> 17:33.030
offering a reward for our capture.

320
17:33.030 --> 17:33.620
(Wanted)

321
17:33.630 --> 17:34.270
Chief,

322
17:34.830 --> 17:36.400
we should hurry back out to sea.

323
17:50.720 --> 17:51.400
Chief...

324
17:51.550 --> 17:53.030
No... Young Master!

325
17:53.030 --> 17:53.680
I was wrong.

326
17:53.750 --> 17:54.700
I won't do it again.

327
17:59.310 --> 18:00.750
Young Master, we were wrong.

328
18:01.000 --> 18:01.790
We were wrong.

329
18:01.790 --> 18:02.830
We really were wrong.

330
18:03.400 --> 18:04.310
It was our fault.

331
18:04.310 --> 18:05.440
It was all our fault.

332
18:05.440 --> 18:06.510
We really were wrong.

333
18:08.350 --> 18:10.200
The authorities are looking for pirates.

334
18:11.550 --> 18:13.880
You're all respectable merchants with clean records.

335
18:14.110 --> 18:15.270
What are you afraid of?

336
18:16.920 --> 18:17.350
Yes.

337
18:18.160 --> 18:19.640
You're right, Young Master.

338
18:19.640 --> 18:20.400
We're not afraid.

339
18:21.310 --> 18:21.790
Not afraid.

340
18:21.920 --> 18:22.720
Get out, all of you.

341
18:22.856 --> 18:23.920
Thank you, Young Master.

342
19:25.880 --> 19:27.200
You want to serve me?

343
19:30.310 --> 19:31.110
Yes.

344
20:05.440 --> 20:06.310
Finish the job,

345
20:06.696 --> 20:08.550
and then clean yourself up and come serve me.

346
20:21.830 --> 20:22.920
Xie Zhao,

347
20:25.880 --> 20:27.350
I underestimated you.

348
20:34.620 --> 20:41.740
(Wanted)

349
20:41.750 --> 20:43.550
Lin Jinqi.

350
20:44.030 --> 20:45.830
Xu Lanxiang.

351
20:48.110 --> 20:49.720
It's been sixteen years.

352
20:52.720 --> 20:53.720
You don't even

353
20:55.350 --> 20:56.880
recognize me anymore.

354
21:02.580 --> 21:08.700
(Glorify the Family Name)

355
21:24.160 --> 21:25.160
Xiuwan.

356
21:26.590 --> 21:27.680
Wrong.

357
21:28.830 --> 21:29.720
Xiushu.

358
21:31.960 --> 21:32.960
Wrong again.

359
21:33.550 --> 21:34.480
Xiuru.

360
21:36.720 --> 21:38.240
Lanxiang, you're biased against me.

361
21:38.550 --> 21:40.480
Can't I laugh and joke around

362
21:40.590 --> 21:42.110
like Xiuwan and Xiushu?

363
21:43.790 --> 21:45.030
I was being unfair.

364
21:45.350 --> 21:46.510
Forgive me, Xiuru.

365
21:47.688 --> 21:49.310
What are you thinking about, Lanxiang?

366
21:49.440 --> 21:50.720
You were so lost in thought

367
21:50.920 --> 21:52.510
you didn't even hear us come in.

368
21:53.640 --> 21:55.920
In the letter left by the righteous man who saved you,

369
21:56.000 --> 21:57.720
he drew portraits of three pirates.

370
21:58.480 --> 22:00.310
One of them had half his face covered.

371
22:00.680 --> 22:01.720
For some reason,

372
22:02.070 --> 22:03.240
I keep thinking about him.

373
22:03.368 --> 22:05.816
I feel as though I've seen him somewhere before.

374
22:06.240 --> 22:07.480
But when I think carefully,

375
22:08.030 --> 22:10.240
I've never seen a man who looks like him.

376
22:19.000 --> 22:20.400
What about you, Xiuwan?

377
22:24.110 --> 22:27.160
Me? You know me.

378
22:27.720 --> 22:30.070
I can't even remember what the kidnapper

379
22:30.070 --> 22:31.640
who chased me with a knife looked like.

380
22:32.400 --> 22:33.310
Xiuwan,

381
22:33.550 --> 22:34.830
you're really no help at all.

382
22:35.208 --> 22:36.328
I was terrified at the time.

383
22:36.330 --> 22:38.580
I was so panicked. All I could think about was escaping.

384
22:38.600 --> 22:40.568
How could I have stopped to look at his face?

385
22:43.030 --> 22:44.030
Lanxiang,

386
22:44.400 --> 22:45.350
look at her.

387
22:45.790 --> 22:47.830
Xiuru is getting fiercer by the day.

388
22:47.896 --> 22:50.616
What happened to the sweet and delicate girl she used to be?

389
22:55.110 --> 22:56.790
Xiuru is indeed more...

390
23:14.200 --> 23:15.000
Lanxiang?

391
23:17.030 --> 23:18.070
I remember

392
23:18.750 --> 23:19.880
who that man looks like.

393
23:22.720 --> 23:24.510
Xiuwan and I know him, too?

394
23:27.720 --> 23:29.000
Du Cuique.

395
23:35.240 --> 23:36.030
Back then,

396
23:36.960 --> 23:38.590
Du Cuique was sentenced to exile...

397
23:38.920 --> 23:40.070
Qiongzhou...

398
23:40.640 --> 23:42.920
On the way to Qiongzhou,

399
23:43.032 --> 23:45.800
Du Cuique fell ill with malaria after failing to adapt to the climate.

400
23:45.880 --> 23:47.110
Then she encountered bandits.

401
23:48.000 --> 23:49.640
In the chaos, she failed to escape

402
23:50.200 --> 23:51.240
and was killed.

403
23:52.200 --> 23:53.920
Du Cuique is cunning

404
23:53.960 --> 23:55.400
and skilled at manipulating people.

405
23:56.110 --> 23:58.200
Perhaps she wasn't killed by the bandits at all,

406
23:58.408 --> 24:00.984
but instead seized the opportunity to fake her death and escape.

407
24:01.310 --> 24:02.590
Lanxiang is right.

408
24:03.400 --> 24:05.750
Du Cuique may have had someone die in her place

409
24:06.480 --> 24:07.720
and left with the bandits.

410
24:08.790 --> 24:10.160
But the pirate leader

411
24:10.960 --> 24:11.960
is a man.

412
24:14.590 --> 24:16.310
I had a vague feeling something was off,

413
24:16.360 --> 24:18.040
but no matter how hard I thought about it,

414
24:18.070 --> 24:20.270
I couldn't recall any man with a similar face.

415
24:20.360 --> 24:22.510
That's because I was thinking in the wrong direction.

416
24:23.070 --> 24:24.350
I simply assumed

417
24:24.480 --> 24:26.960
that since the pirate in the portrait was their leader,

418
24:27.310 --> 24:28.720
he must naturally be a man.

419
24:30.480 --> 24:33.030
I always say we shouldn't underestimate women,

420
24:33.590 --> 24:35.550
yet I let my own assumptions

421
24:36.310 --> 24:37.400
blind me.

422
24:42.920 --> 24:43.750
Impossible.

423
24:46.550 --> 24:47.830
If it really was Du Cuique,

424
24:48.510 --> 24:50.160
why would she let me escape so easily?

425
24:50.830 --> 24:52.720
Du Cuique hasn't changed.

426
24:53.416 --> 24:56.264
She still treats servants and commoners as if their lives mean nothing.

427
24:56.408 --> 24:57.680
She probably never even looked

428
24:57.680 --> 24:59.550
at the weavers they abducted.

429
25:08.110 --> 25:09.590
Whether it's Du Cuique or not,

430
25:10.110 --> 25:11.640
we need to tell His Lordship at once.

431
25:33.110 --> 25:33.920
It's her.

432
25:35.160 --> 25:36.160
It's Du Cuique.

433
25:37.400 --> 25:38.200
Xiuwan.

434
25:42.720 --> 25:44.240
Lanxiang and I have both confirmed it.

435
25:44.590 --> 25:46.000
Jinqi has seen Du Cuique, too.

436
25:46.550 --> 25:47.720
Once he confirms it,

437
25:47.880 --> 25:49.200
we can be absolutely certain.

438
25:51.590 --> 25:52.790
Other than Lanxiang,

439
25:53.960 --> 25:55.160
what woman's face

440
25:55.160 --> 25:57.048
could I possibly remember for over ten years?

441
25:59.550 --> 26:01.720
I can't even remember now

442
26:01.864 --> 26:03.528
whether her eyes were big or small.

443
26:21.200 --> 26:21.960
Don't be afraid.

444
26:25.000 --> 26:26.720
Even Xiuru has grown fierce now.

445
26:27.440 --> 26:29.510
Even if Du Cuique has come back from the dead,

446
26:30.350 --> 26:31.920
if we caught her once,

447
26:32.480 --> 26:33.920
we can catch her again.

448
27:20.310 --> 27:21.550
It's Du Cuique.

449
27:22.830 --> 27:24.000
A pirate leader

450
27:24.504 --> 27:25.790
wouldn't leave her hideout at sea

451
27:26.480 --> 27:27.960
and risk coming to Jinling

452
27:29.160 --> 27:30.640
just for the weavers.

453
27:31.464 --> 27:33.944
She must be here to take revenge on Jinqi and Lanxiang.

454
27:40.790 --> 27:43.110
Let Lin Jinqi and Xu Lanxiang

455
27:44.640 --> 27:46.310
think I came to Jinling

456
27:46.960 --> 27:48.310
for revenge.

457
27:52.000 --> 27:52.790
But then again,

458
27:53.830 --> 27:54.920
it's not entirely wrong.

459
27:56.440 --> 27:58.750
I do want them dead.

460
28:01.790 --> 28:02.720
My brother

461
28:04.240 --> 28:06.160
is still waiting in the underworld

462
28:07.310 --> 28:09.200
for them to answer for what they did.

463
28:12.380 --> 28:20.180
(Glorify the Family Name)

464
28:26.590 --> 28:28.550
I'll help you kill them.

465
28:36.480 --> 28:38.240
I once went to great lengths

466
28:39.200 --> 28:40.880
to marry into the Lin family.

467
28:45.960 --> 28:47.720
I really did choose well.

468
28:49.240 --> 28:50.880
I wasn't wrong about him at all.

469
28:54.510 --> 28:57.480
Lin Jinqi was indeed made a marquis and granted a title.

470
29:00.920 --> 29:01.920
What a pity.

471
29:03.240 --> 29:04.440
I wasn't skilled enough

472
29:05.310 --> 29:06.640
and lost by a single move.

473
29:08.400 --> 29:09.400
Otherwise,

474
29:11.750 --> 29:12.790
by now,

475
29:14.000 --> 29:17.030
I'd be the Marchioness of Marquis Jing'an's Residence.

476
29:21.790 --> 29:23.480
Why is there still no word from the north?

477
29:31.920 --> 29:34.070
Once you return with news from the Zhejiang coast,

478
29:36.030 --> 29:38.030
there will be good news.

479
29:53.310 --> 29:55.440
Lin Jinqi.

480
30:06.270 --> 30:07.510
You're highly skilled in combat.

481
30:08.310 --> 30:09.830
Why would you commit such treason

482
30:10.310 --> 30:11.920
and kill a court official?

483
30:12.720 --> 30:14.070
On the Chief's orders,

484
30:14.536 --> 30:15.960
I've come to deliver you a letter!

485
30:27.512 --> 30:29.070
And take your head while I'm at it,

486
30:29.070 --> 30:30.110
as an offering to Du Zheng!

487
30:47.510 --> 30:48.270
Du Zheng.

488
31:04.680 --> 31:06.070
I'll hold them off.

489
31:06.664 --> 31:08.392
You hurry back to Jinling and report this.

490
31:09.260 --> 31:11.480
(Ding Peng) I'll hold them off. You should leave.

491
31:11.550 --> 31:12.550
That's an order.

492
31:19.440 --> 31:20.920
Du Zheng deserved to die.

493
31:26.480 --> 31:27.830
Even if I hadn't killed him,

494
31:28.920 --> 31:30.240
his crimes were unforgivable.

495
31:31.960 --> 31:32.960
Kill him!

496
31:44.350 --> 31:45.030
Ding Peng!

497
31:45.400 --> 31:46.160
Go!

498
31:48.960 --> 31:49.640
Go!

499
31:49.640 --> 31:50.510
Hurry!

500
31:55.480 --> 31:57.110
You have plundered the people

501
31:57.400 --> 31:58.830
and taken countless lives.

502
31:59.270 --> 32:00.830
By law, you must be executed.

503
35:51.960 --> 35:53.630
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

504
35:54.190 --> 35:56.000
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

505
35:57.190 --> 35:59.150
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

506
35:59.820 --> 36:02.860
(Jinling Defense Command)

507
36:15.360 --> 36:17.528
His Majesty personally led a campaign against Wona.

508
36:18.280 --> 36:19.480
After reaching Huailai,

509
36:20.070 --> 36:23.360
he was misled by Wang Yi, Chief Eunuch of the Directorate of Ceremonial.

510
36:23.670 --> 36:25.510
Ignoring the objections of his generals,

511
36:26.030 --> 36:28.110
he ordered the camp moved closer to the water.

512
36:28.710 --> 36:33.150
Wona forces charged down from Yao'er Ridge.

513
36:40.000 --> 36:41.440
The imperial banners fell.

514
36:41.752 --> 36:44.408
The bodies of civil and military officials covered the fields.

515
36:44.440 --> 36:45.320
His Majesty...

516
36:45.960 --> 36:48.630
His Majesty was captured by the enemy.

517
36:51.360 --> 36:52.400
That can't be!

518
36:52.488 --> 36:54.810
His Majesty marched out with two hundred thousand troops!

519
36:54.960 --> 36:57.224
How could these tens of thousands of Wona soldiers...

520
36:58.670 --> 36:59.440
capture him?

521
37:00.550 --> 37:01.150
This...

522
37:01.920 --> 37:03.880
What are we to do?

523
37:04.440 --> 37:07.670
What should we do now?

524
37:08.040 --> 37:09.624
It is now the end of the ninth month.

525
37:09.880 --> 37:11.280
His Majesty has been held captive

526
37:11.510 --> 37:12.710
for over a month.

527
37:13.400 --> 37:15.710
Your Grace, do you know the situation in the capital?

528
37:16.232 --> 37:18.184
Has the Empress Dowager issued any decree?

529
37:18.710 --> 37:21.710
The realm cannot be without a ruler for even a day.

530
37:22.712 --> 37:24.550
After the terrible news reached the capital,

531
37:24.920 --> 37:27.110
the Empress Dowager accepted Han Liang's proposal

532
37:27.550 --> 37:29.670
and installed Prince Chen as the new Emperor.

533
37:30.920 --> 37:31.840
Now, His Majesty

534
37:32.000 --> 37:34.970
(His Majesty, formerly Prince Chen) has successfully ascended the throne.

535
37:34.984 --> 37:37.400
Han Liang was appointed Minister of War.

536
37:39.030 --> 37:41.030
Minister Han has ordered

537
37:42.000 --> 37:44.190
troops from across the realm to rush to the capital

538
37:44.440 --> 37:46.760
and join forces against the Wona army.

539
37:46.960 --> 37:49.070
The Jinling Defense Command is hereby ordered

540
37:49.070 --> 37:50.960
to allocate bows, crossbows, swords, and spears,

541
37:50.960 --> 37:53.160
one million two hundred sixty thousand weapons in total,

542
37:53.192 --> 37:55.416
along with four hundred thousand shi of provisions.

543
37:55.720 --> 37:58.400
The Longjiang Garrison shall select two thousand elite soldiers

544
37:58.710 --> 38:00.590
to escort them to the capital.

545
38:01.920 --> 38:02.710
We obey.

546
38:03.550 --> 38:06.960
The Wona army is at the gates of the capital.

547
38:07.150 --> 38:08.510
I ask all of you

548
38:08.590 --> 38:10.150
to stand together

549
38:10.480 --> 38:12.840
and resist the enemy.

550
38:13.000 --> 38:13.800
- Yes. - Yes.

551
38:23.230 --> 38:24.110
Mother.

552
38:26.840 --> 38:28.190
I want to give some to Father.

553
38:28.190 --> 38:29.440
Zhangrun, don't be naughty.

554
38:38.400 --> 38:38.880
Come.

555
38:59.070 --> 39:01.230
Zhangrun prepared some Chinese yam cakes for you.

556
39:03.800 --> 39:04.590
Really?

557
39:16.400 --> 39:19.110
Thank you, Zhangrun, for the cakes.

558
39:20.190 --> 39:21.400
Thank you, Zhangcheng,

559
39:21.840 --> 39:23.230
for helping me pack.

560
39:29.630 --> 39:31.480
This is a protective charm I prayed for.

561
39:32.230 --> 39:35.280
My teacher said weapons show no mercy on the battlefield.

562
39:35.670 --> 39:37.800
Father, you must be careful.

563
39:38.550 --> 39:40.030
You must come home safely.

564
39:45.360 --> 39:46.480
I'll remember that.

565
39:47.110 --> 39:48.550
I'll be sure to come home safely.

566
40:02.780 --> 40:04.660
(Blessing)

567
40:07.530 --> 40:10.530
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

568
40:11.660 --> 40:15.220
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

569
40:15.900 --> 40:18.720
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

570
40:19.620 --> 40:22.820
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

571
40:23.960 --> 40:26.470
♪And the worries etched between our brows♪

572
40:26.500 --> 40:27.230
It's very late.

573
40:27.630 --> 40:29.150
Zhangrun should go to bed.

574
40:29.320 --> 40:30.920
Otherwise, you won't grow tall.

575
40:31.960 --> 40:32.880
Go to bed now.

576
40:32.880 --> 40:35.560
♪While two pairs of eyes watch from below♪

577
40:38.110 --> 40:41.740
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

578
40:43.360 --> 40:44.000
Go on.

579
40:46.500 --> 40:50.970
♪Four seasons wax and wane, year after year♪

580
40:51.912 --> 40:53.230
It's dark and raining heavily.

581
40:53.630 --> 40:54.670
Take a few more lanterns.

582
40:55.110 --> 40:56.630
Watch your step. The road is slippery.

583
40:58.150 --> 40:58.710
Yes.

584
41:01.030 --> 41:01.590
Let's go.

585
41:03.140 --> 41:07.360
♪The journey home always carries joy and sorrow♪

586
41:07.650 --> 41:11.970
♪People gather, then part♪

587
41:57.070 --> 41:58.550
The situation in the capital

588
41:58.800 --> 42:00.000
is uncertain now.

589
42:00.728 --> 42:03.510
And Du Cuique is still lurking in the shadows, waiting for her chance.

590
42:04.920 --> 42:07.960
Yet I've been ordered to escort provisions to the capital.

591
42:09.510 --> 42:10.320
The burden

592
42:11.230 --> 42:12.480
on your shoulders

593
42:13.230 --> 42:14.230
is no lighter than mine.

594
42:20.070 --> 42:21.710
Du Zheng died because of you.

595
42:22.150 --> 42:23.800
Du Cuique was convicted because of me.

596
42:25.150 --> 42:26.800
I understand why she wants revenge.

597
42:28.070 --> 42:29.590
But it's been sixteen years.

598
42:30.800 --> 42:32.550
Why did she wait until now

599
42:33.000 --> 42:34.760
when the Retired Emperor has been captured,

600
42:35.150 --> 42:36.510
and the capital is under siege?

601
42:40.320 --> 42:41.110
Could it be

602
42:41.960 --> 42:43.510
that fortune truly favors the wicked

603
42:43.608 --> 42:45.320
and handed Du Cuique this opportunity?

604
42:48.510 --> 42:49.400
You suspect

605
42:50.800 --> 42:52.670
Du Cuique deliberately chose this moment?

606
42:58.550 --> 42:59.190
Your Lordship!

607
43:00.110 --> 43:00.880
Your Lordship!

608
43:05.020 --> 43:07.940
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

609
43:09.190 --> 43:13.670
Strike a man in the face and attack his sorest point.

610
43:15.440 --> 43:17.400
Such underhanded tactics

611
43:18.030 --> 43:19.440
would never occur to someone

612
43:19.440 --> 43:21.032
of Lin Jinqi's privileged upbringing.

613
43:22.110 --> 43:24.710
Only that lowly servant Xu Lanxiang

614
43:25.280 --> 43:27.030
knows what I want

615
43:27.030 --> 43:28.320
and what I despise.

616
43:29.150 --> 43:30.550
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang for you

617
43:30.670 --> 43:33.800
and wash away today's humiliation with her blood.

618
43:37.440 --> 43:39.150
This time, I'll do it myself.

619
43:42.590 --> 43:45.150
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang with my own hands.

620
44:01.860 --> 44:05.980
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

621
44:08.820 --> 44:13.340
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

622
44:14.620 --> 44:18.540
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

623
44:19.220 --> 44:21.980
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

624
44:22.700 --> 44:25.020
♪Though all the world may fade♪

625
44:25.020 --> 44:28.100
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

626
44:29.620 --> 44:33.860
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

627
44:36.780 --> 44:40.940
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

628
44:42.740 --> 44:46.300
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

629
44:46.300 --> 44:49.860
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

630
44:50.660 --> 44:56.340
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

631
44:56.700 --> 45:01.020
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

632
45:01.380 --> 45:04.340
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

633
45:04.340 --> 45:08.100
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

634
45:08.100 --> 45:10.980
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

635
45:10.980 --> 45:15.060
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

636
45:15.060 --> 45:18.420
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

637
45:18.420 --> 45:22.180
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

638
45:22.180 --> 45:26.180
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

639
45:26.940 --> 45:31.100
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

640
45:31.100 --> 45:34.540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

641
45:34.540 --> 45:38.180
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

642
